# Installed as ~deploy/.ssh/authorized_keys by netcrawl-sync. Public keys only.
#
# One line per NetCrawl CI environment key, each forced through rrsync so it
# can only write files under /srv/netcrawl/www: no shell, no forwarding, no
# reads, no deletes. Pruning old releases is netcrawl-sync's job.
#
#   command="/usr/bin/rrsync -wo -no-del /srv/netcrawl/www",restrict ssh-ed25519 AAAA... netcrawl-dev-deploy
#
# Empty until NetCrawl's web workflow has a deploy key (rollout phase 1b in
# docs/netcrawl-web.md). Removing a line here revokes that key within one
# sync.
